{
  "fragmentCount": 16,
  "fragments": [
    {
      "contentSha256": "d7e40d28ed269fde23eaadbf660614472366bb08ebaddeb74435c764a9fcb5dc",
      "contentText": "**第一条** 为规范 DEMO-BANK 对公产品对外销售与推介行为，落实\"将合适的产品提供给合适的客户\"要求，制定本办法。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0001",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 1,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "863dcf950b57566306b2e0d833b7aa970497dcf7994f8580e0280a5851e61c7f",
      "contentText": "**第二条** 本办法适用于 DEMO-BANK 各级机构及从业人员对全部对公产品的销售、推介与协议签署行为。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0002",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 2,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "54e181dde4a115a0040d4e6061c8e69f92601362efa3deb3290a268031e8a29d",
      "contentText": "**第三条** 销售适当性应当以客户风险承受能力、经营需求与资金用途匹配性为核心判断依据。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0003",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 3,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "abf87f98c30f15e6616543ea0edaadd6aad33fd874e4090a0a184bc6fa965196",
      "contentText": "**第四条** 对公客户风险承受能力分为四级：保守型、稳健型、平衡型、进取型；评估结果有效期一年，客户经营状况发生重大变化的应当重新评估。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0004",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 4,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "ab5699c9acdafd3d96588241e729b68bb560b780d96f0bb3d8c26ac579b46e15",
      "contentText": "**第五条** 对公产品风险等级分为五级：R1 至 R5，由产品管理部门在准入时确定并随条款变更同步复核。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0005",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 5,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "c826823a8e24f93e124bc49efd67eff3391e327b2ea6fbaaeda41d12e07f265f",
      "contentText": "**第六条** 匹配规则为：保守型客户不得配置 R3 及以上产品；稳健型客户不得配置 R4 及以上产品；平衡型客户不得配置 R5 产品；进取型客户不设上限，但仍须逐笔核验资金用途合规性。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0006",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 6,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "961148acda1d56125e48f37c8e2da26338661057b38ebdb4a954b57312fadd04",
      "contentText": "**第七条** 销售过程中不得向客户承诺下列内容：审批结果、授信额度、放款或开立时限、最终利率或费率、监管报送结果。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0007",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 7,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "26a7b852d756616cf240dcc8f4e1910f4ee638d005fef93c176ba7254447a378",
      "contentText": "**第八条** 禁止下列行为：一、代替客户签署协议或代为操作企业网银、银企直联；二、使用\"保本\"\"保收益\"\"内部渠道\"\"保证批\"等表述；三、隐瞒产品或条款的不利条件；四、以不实材料协助客户通过准入核验。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0008",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 8,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "c9b1ad58e5163544ffc4dc649e7549276b97a40dbb3c453017835a58de15d986",
      "contentText": "**第九条** 对客口径要求：涉及准入条件、价格、期限、办理时限的表述，应当以受控产品解读口径与最终批复协议为准；尚未核定或未取得证据支持的口径，不得对客作确定性表述。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0009",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 9,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "b2c327e459a8c13f26534d9d9cc2ba7e81c7152fd2ef41252ba8aa3bffbddfa4",
      "contentText": "**第十条** 从业人员不掌握或无法核验的口径，应当明确告知客户\"以正式批复与协议为准\"，不得推测作答。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0010",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 10,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "6519b4fa1ff37f72c6ba8b7f170018b858623b1a282f04ac2eb17f60b8d50c0d",
      "contentText": "**第十一条** 柜面首次签约须进行双录；线上渠道销售须留存操作日志、协议签署记录与告知确认记录。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0011",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 11,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "e08481db8015be9a62a8ac5c163b39d39b317baf6923155fa7d7a4019623da9d",
      "contentText": "**第十二条** 销售留痕材料保存期不少于五年，保存期内不得删改。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0012",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 12,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "0a8d96b41fed4a6562cf676bfd048e809733e06bcd2d37525e200d2c03f4093b",
      "contentText": "**第十三条** 违反本办法的，按内部问责规定处理；给客户造成损失的，依法承担相应责任。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0013",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 13,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "321567ba73ccedc2662f7012b4068dfb2cfd0ec622c22e65164818f6717c2c3b",
      "contentText": "**第十四条** 本办法与具体产品销售规则不一致的，按\"从严从高\"原则执行。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0014",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 14,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "74be99da3fa790f073434dc0f761b1a72d21f3fc29b5666d31ed75733ac04055",
      "contentText": "**第十五条** 本办法由 DEMO-BANK 合规管理部负责解释与修订。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0015",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 15,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    },
    {
      "contentSha256": "c9228e065b247decbd7abd6381f28ef2ddecfd0c35c15a24f23e07df97f4ea6e",
      "contentText": "**第十六条** 本办法自发布之日起施行。",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM003-0016",
      "pageNo": null,
      "seqNo": 16,
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
    }
  ],
  "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-003",
  "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM003-20260922-4713b5e3"
}
